                                  WS-KEY-POLICY
               END-UNSTRING.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       EXPAND-COLOUR-0005.
               EVALUATE TRUE
                  WHEN WS-PREMIUM-TOTAL < 999
                       MOVE 1 TO WS-PREMIUM-BAND
